## Summary of the Workflow

If you want to look at graphs of raw solar data, you run the scripts in the **root directory** (like `flare_detection.py`).

If you want to train the AI or make predictions, you use the structured pipeline via **`flare_forecast/main.py`**. The AI pipeline pulls data using `dataset.py`, transforms it with `preprocessing.py`, learns using `trainer.py` and `model.py`, and predicts future flares using `predict.py`.
